Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
## Chemical / Molecular Framework
We improved support for many functions in WL's `Molecule*` and `ChemicalReaction` frameworks. Here are a few examples of creating molecules.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Chemical / Molecular Framework
We improved support for many functions in WL's `Molecule*` and `ChemicalReaction` frameworks. Here are a few examples of creating molecules.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Construct a water molecule using bonds:


%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Construct a water molecule using bonds:


%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
m = Molecule[
  {"O", "H", "H"},
  {
    Bond[{1, 2}, "Single"],
    Bond[{1, 3}, "Single"]
  }
]

MoleculeValue[m, "MolecularMass"]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Molecule[(*VB[*) {"O", "H", "H"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Single"], Bond[{1, 3}, "Single"]}, {} (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(Quantity[18.015`4.6974178551775845, "AtomicMassUnit"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KWnMIB4vkAjLTC13SU3OL0osyS8K5gCKBJYm5pVkllQGSQI5hhZ6BoamCSZ6ZpbmJobmFqamhubmphYmpsF8QFnHkvzczGTfxOLi0LzMEgDEZxkw"*)(*]VB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Create a molecule from a SMILES string:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Create a molecule from a SMILES string:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
m = Molecule["NC(=O)C[C@H](C(=O)O)N"]
MoleculePlot[m, ImageSize->400]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Molecule[(*VB[*) {"N", "C", "O", "C", Atom["C", "HydrogenCount" -> 1], "C", "O", "O", "N"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Single"], Bond[{2, 3}, "Double"], Bond[{2, 4}, "Single"], Bond[{4, 5}, "Single"], Bond[{5, 6}, "Single"], Bond[{6, 7}, "Double"], Bond[{6, 8}, "Single"], Bond[{5, 9}, "Single"]}, {StereochemistryElements -> {<|"StereoType" -> "Tetrahedral", "ChiralCenter" -> 5, "Direction" -> "Counterclockwise"|>}} (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
