Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
### Reactions
Define a chemical reaction and then balance it:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
### Reactions
Define a chemical reaction and then balance it:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
reaction = ChemicalReaction["Bi(NO3)3 + NaOH -> Bi(OH)3 + NaNO3"]
reaction // ReactionBalance

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ChemicalReaction[(*VB[*) <|ChemicalFormula[{"Bi" -> 1, {"N" -> 1, "O" -> 3} -> 3}] -> 1, ChemicalFormula[{"Na" -> 1, "O" -> 1, "H" -> 1}] -> 1|> -> <|ChemicalFormula[{"Bi" -> 1, {"O" -> 1, "H" -> 1} -> 3}] -> 1, ChemicalFormula[{"Na" -> 1, "N" -> 1, "O" -> 3}] -> 1|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ChemicalReaction[(*VB[*) <|ChemicalFormula[{"Bi" -> 1, {"N" -> 1, "O" -> 3} -> 3}] -> 1, ChemicalFormula[{"Na" -> 1, "O" -> 1, "H" -> 1}] -> 3|> -> <|ChemicalFormula[{"Bi" -> 1, {"O" -> 1, "H" -> 1} -> 3}] -> 1, ChemicalFormula[{"Na" -> 1, "N" -> 1, "O" -> 3}] -> 3|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Create a reaction explicitly from molecules using SMILES notation (crazy people—water is just `O`...):

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Create a reaction explicitly from molecules using SMILES notation (crazy people—water is just `O`...):

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
methane = Molecule["C"];
oxygen = Molecule["O=O"];
carbonDioxide = Molecule["O=C=O"];
water = Molecule["O"];

combustion = ChemicalReaction[
  <|methane -> 1, oxygen -> 2|> ->
  <|carbonDioxide -> 1, water -> 2|>
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ChemicalReaction[(*VB[*) <|Molecule[{"C"}, {}, {}] -> 1, Molecule[{"O", "O"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Double"]}, {}] -> 2|> -> <|Molecule[{"O", "C", "O"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Double"], Bond[{2, 3}, "Double"]}, {}] -> 1, Molecule[{"O"}, {}, {}] -> 2|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Read some of its properties:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Read some of its properties:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
combustion["EquationString"]
combustion["ReverseReaction"]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
"CH4 + 2O2 --> CO2 + 2H2O"

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ChemicalReaction[(*VB[*) <|Molecule[{"O", "C", "O"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Double"], Bond[{2, 3}, "Double"]}, {}] -> 1, Molecule[{"O"}, {}, {}] -> 2|> -> <|Molecule[{"C"}, {}, {}] -> 1, Molecule[{"O", "O"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Double"]}, {}] -> 2|> (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

